(5205647, 755961, 54645, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I''m wagering this will get DQ''d. It looks like you are sitting on something that was cloned out or you combined two images. I would like this better if the shoe did not look like it was resting on the floor. Again love the idea. I''ll give it a 5 for the concept and humor. BTW he looks awfully sour for being high on life! Maybe it''s a bad trip! ;)</td>', 'Cool idea. I''m wagering this will get DQ''d. It looks like you are sitting on something that was cloned out or you combined two images. I would like this better if the shoe did not look like it was resting on the floor. Again love the idea. I''ll give it a 5 for the concept and humor. BTW he looks awfully sour for being high on life! Maybe it''s a bad trip! ;)', '2009-01-19 23:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205692, 757665, 56828, '<td valign="top">I love the use of the window for natural light.  And quite frankly your model makes this photos work.  This is a great shot that any parent would love in their home.</td>', 'I love the use of the window for natural light.  And quite frankly your model makes this photos work.  This is a great shot that any parent would love in their home.', '2009-01-19 23:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
