(5205700, 757789, 56828, '<td valign="top">The focus is great here.  You captured the details well.  I really like the symmetry captured using the arms to frame his facial expression.  And the post on the eyes is amazing.</td>', 'The focus is great here.  You captured the details well.  I really like the symmetry captured using the arms to frame his facial expression.  And the post on the eyes is amazing.', '2009-01-19 23:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205708, 757053, 56828, '<td valign="top">First off, your model was a great actress.  It''s hard to get models to capture a pose like this without actually cutting the water on her lol.  The whole set up and lighting is really good.  I love the smile on her face with the.  Hmm I wonder if she asked why you wanted her in the tub fully dressed lol.</td>', 'First off, your model was a great actress.  It''s hard to get models to capture a pose like this without actually cutting the water on her lol.  The whole set up and lighting is really good.  I love the smile on her face with the.  Hmm I wonder if she asked why you wanted her in the tub fully dressed lol.', '2009-01-19 23:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205710, 757128, 56828, '<td valign="top">They symbolism is just amazing.  I like the model looking up, showing that he hasn''t reach his destination yet, he''s not content and is still going up.</td>', 'They symbolism is just amazing.  I like the model looking up, showing that he hasn''t reach his destination yet, he''s not content and is still going up.', '2009-01-19 23:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205711, 757080, 56828, '<td valign="top">Alot of people took straight portrait shots with very little facial expression.  You took a portrait shot with a slight expression that speaks volumes.  I love the shot.  I like the lighting and the details present.  The DOF pulls you right to his face and eyes.</td>', 'Alot of people took straight portrait shots with very little facial expression.  You took a portrait shot with a slight expression that speaks volumes.  I love the shot.  I like the lighting and the details present.  The DOF pulls you right to his face and eyes.', '2009-01-19 23:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205719, 757639, 56828, '<td valign="top">How can you not love a well executed shot of a kid having fun.   The DOF is excellent here, and your surrounding scene couldn''t be better.</td>', 'How can you not love a well executed shot of a kid having fun.   The DOF is excellent here, and your surrounding scene couldn''t be better.', '2009-01-19 23:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
