(5205834, 757854, 70000, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of different elements competing here that don''t really allow the photo to emphasize calmness as much as it good. The pattern of the straps around her neck compete with the pattern of the blue ball and the textured brown that she is around. Then there is the shadow in the background and harsh shadows on her arm, all different colors that clash a little bit. She is also wearing a nice diamond earring which doesn''t really go with the casualness of her outfit. Many of the problems may have been solved if this had been in black and white though. Still, beautiful model and interesting concept.</td>', 'There are a lot of different elements competing here that don''t really allow the photo to emphasize calmness as much as it good. The pattern of the straps around her neck compete with the pattern of the blue ball and the textured brown that she is around. Then there is the shadow in the background and harsh shadows on her arm, all different colors that clash a little bit. She is also wearing a nice diamond earring which doesn''t really go with the casualness of her outfit. Many of the problems may have been solved if this had been in black and white though. Still, beautiful model and interesting concept.', '2009-01-20 00:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205835, 757466, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! The kids in the background really add to the shot. Great location and lighting too</td>', 'Wonderful! The kids in the background really add to the shot. Great location and lighting too', '2009-01-20 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205837, 757854, 86331, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Nice lighting, but that blue sphere-shaped object in front of her arm, and the (curtains?) behind her arm are distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Nice lighting, but that blue sphere-shaped object in front of her arm, and the (curtains?) behind her arm are distracting.', '2009-01-20 00:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205839, 757757, 70000, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! I like the angle and perspective, but the lighting pulls the viewer away from her face, and this could be good if the background had something important or interesting in it, but it doesn''t really. More light on her face might have been ideal.</td>', 'Fun shot! I like the angle and perspective, but the lighting pulls the viewer away from her face, and this could be good if the background had something important or interesting in it, but it doesn''t really. More light on her face might have been ideal.', '2009-01-20 00:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205842, 757639, 70000, '<td valign="top">HAH! This is FANTASTIC! Definitely my favorite child shot so far. The distance between her and the bed really makes the shot, and I especially love the bright red of her dress against the subtle whites of the background. You may have wanted to go through and cloned out the halo from sharpening, but this is so fun I didn''t even notice it at first.</td>', 'HAH! This is FANTASTIC! Definitely my favorite child shot so far. The distance between her and the bed really makes the shot, and I especially love the bright red of her dress against the subtle whites of the background. You may have wanted to go through and cloned out the halo from sharpening, but this is so fun I didn''t even notice it at first.', '2009-01-20 00:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205891, 757687, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice and relaxed, great lighting and composition.  I like the hint of self exposed here.  Still leaves a bit to be discovered though, which is nice.</td>', 'Nice and relaxed, great lighting and composition.  I like the hint of self exposed here.  Still leaves a bit to be discovered though, which is nice.', '2009-01-20 01:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
