(5206766, 757290, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting for a group studio portrait.  7 from me.</td>', 'Very nice lighting for a group studio portrait.  7 from me.', '2009-01-20 13:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206769, 757481, 15204, '<td valign="top">Kind of creepy for a little kid photograph, but it certainly has personality and all of my kids have exhibited that personality at one time or another for sure.  7 from me.</td>', 'Kind of creepy for a little kid photograph, but it certainly has personality and all of my kids have exhibited that personality at one time or another for sure.  7 from me.', '2009-01-20 13:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206771, 757450, 15204, '<td valign="top">I gave you an extra point for getting a catchlight into the dark eye on such a dramatically lit portrait.  I like the lighting highlighting the face and the neck of the guitar.  7 from me.</td>', 'I gave you an extra point for getting a catchlight into the dark eye on such a dramatically lit portrait.  I like the lighting highlighting the face and the neck of the guitar.  7 from me.', '2009-01-20 13:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206773, 757128, 55837, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Perfect for stock.....except....the shadow on the backdrop.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Perfect for stock.....except....the shadow on the backdrop.', '2009-01-20 13:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206779, 757821, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like your low angle here.  I think it really emphasizes the pregnant belly and make it the subject of the iamge.  A beautiful maternity portrait.</td>', 'I like your low angle here.  I think it really emphasizes the pregnant belly and make it the subject of the iamge.  A beautiful maternity portrait.', '2009-01-20 13:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206785, 757459, 15204, '<td valign="top">I think if you are going to do a just-eye image you need to get some light into the eye to bring out the shape and different colors and give it some life.  Whatever your light source was here (it looks like it was from below) was not getting into the eye at all.</td>', 'I think if you are going to do a just-eye image you need to get some light into the eye to bring out the shape and different colors and give it some life.  Whatever your light source was here (it looks like it was from below) was not getting into the eye at all.', '2009-01-20 13:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206795, 757286, 100393, '<td valign="top">Though there is technically little to complain about with this shot - the whole ''Check out my armpits!'' thing isn''t really doing it for me.</td>', 'Though there is technically little to complain about with this shot - the whole ''Check out my armpits!'' thing isn''t really doing it for me.', '2009-01-20 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206799, 757128, 100393, '<td valign="top">Leftovers from the Business Person stock photo challenge? Very well executed though!</td>', 'Leftovers from the Business Person stock photo challenge? Very well executed though!', '2009-01-20 13:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206816, 757639, 100393, '<td valign="top">For me, this is on its own at the top.</td>', 'For me, this is on its own at the top.', '2009-01-20 13:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206832, 755680, 327, '<td valign="top">Good title, great entry. Nice work.</td>', 'Good title, great entry. Nice work.', '2009-01-20 14:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206854, 757687, 75192, '<td valign="top">Good looking too! <br/> <br/>Crisp, clear, in-focus, good background, engaging eye contact, good crop, nice processing = 10.</td>', 'Good looking too!  Crisp, clear, in-focus, good background, engaging eye contact, good crop, nice processing = 10.', '2009-01-20 14:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206862, 757300, 75192, '<td valign="top">Aw, really cute. Her sensitivity really does show in this picture too. I was a sensitive child :)</td>', 'Aw, really cute. Her sensitivity really does show in this picture too. I was a sensitive child :)', '2009-01-20 14:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206867, 756262, 75192, '<td valign="top">Fantastic character! Love this one.... his personality comes across stronger than any picture in this competition.</td>', 'Fantastic character! Love this one.... his personality comes across stronger than any picture in this competition.', '2009-01-20 14:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206874, 757475, 75192, '<td valign="top">A creative take on the challenge has to be admired.... hardly anyone takes a risk. But because you have and because the picture is quite engaging, I give you a ten. Good luck!</td>', 'A creative take on the challenge has to be admired.... hardly anyone takes a risk. But because you have and because the picture is quite engaging, I give you a ten. Good luck!', '2009-01-20 14:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206878, 757303, 75192, '<td valign="top">He has lovely laughter lines and he''s handsome - so cheer up buddy! :) <br/> <br/>Good composition and tones.</td>', 'He has lovely laughter lines and he''s handsome - so cheer up buddy! :)  Good composition and tones.', '2009-01-20 14:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206885, 757409, 75192, '<td valign="top">She has beautiful skin, eyes and lips.</td>', 'She has beautiful skin, eyes and lips.', '2009-01-20 14:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206888, 757469, 75192, '<td valign="top">Shame about the noise/grain on her neck and hair. Still a nice shot though!</td>', 'Shame about the noise/grain on her neck and hair. Still a nice shot though!', '2009-01-20 14:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206890, 757762, 75192, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness! She has the cutest little cheeks ever! Awwwww!</td>', 'Oh my goodness! She has the cutest little cheeks ever! Awwwww!', '2009-01-20 14:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5206894, 757520, 75192, '<td valign="top">Love the look on the gentleman''s face... what a kindly man! A lovely shot of them both.</td>', 'Love the look on the gentleman''s face... what a kindly man! A lovely shot of them both.', '2009-01-20 14:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
