(5207364, 755899, 99063, '<td valign="top">I really like this with all of the negative space.  The only thing I would change would be for the focus to be on his eye instead of nose.  :)</td>', 'I really like this with all of the negative space.  The only thing I would change would be for the focus to be on his eye instead of nose.  :)', '2009-01-20 17:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207366, 757090, 76598, '<td valign="top">The image is out of focus and the eyes look really doctored and unreal</td>', 'The image is out of focus and the eyes look really doctored and unreal', '2009-01-20 18:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207369, 757538, 76598, '<td valign="top">Partial faces often work well, but in this case it doesn''t strike me that the point of cutting works right; lighting is a little awkward with the face really dark on the left; and finally the yellow blob on the left is quite distracting</td>', 'Partial faces often work well, but in this case it doesn''t strike me that the point of cutting works right; lighting is a little awkward with the face really dark on the left; and finally the yellow blob on the left is quite distracting', '2009-01-20 18:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207510, 757466, 101445, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of this challenge</td>', 'This is my favorite of this challenge', '2009-01-20 19:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207532, 757639, 37444, '<td valign="top">Lovely!! 8</td>', 'Lovely!! 8', '2009-01-20 20:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207534, 755553, 37444, '<td valign="top">too bad the hat is badly blown</td>', 'too bad the hat is badly blown', '2009-01-20 20:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207535, 757481, 37444, '<td valign="top">scary!</td>', 'scary!', '2009-01-20 20:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207537, 757620, 37444, '<td valign="top">love the composition, angle, everything! 10</td>', 'love the composition, angle, everything! 10', '2009-01-20 20:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207538, 757557, 37444, '<td valign="top">Wow - I''d think to make such a subject harder, not softer as here.</td>', 'Wow - I''d think to make such a subject harder, not softer as here.', '2009-01-20 20:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207541, 757298, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and the crop on this one very much.  The red glasses and the red shirt are great together.  I think if you had stopped down a little more so that her mouth was in better focus if would have even more impact, since the mouth expression is very much part of the image.  To me, the glasses look like the sharpest thing in the image.  The eyes look a bit softer.  I gave it a 7, possible focus issues notwithstanding.  I really like it.</td>', 'I like the comp and the crop on this one very much.  The red glasses and the red shirt are great together.  I think if you had stopped down a little more so that her mouth was in better focus if would have even more impact, since the mouth expression is very much part of the image.  To me, the glasses look like the sharpest thing in the image.  The eyes look a bit softer.  I gave it a 7, possible focus issues notwithstanding.  I really like it.', '2009-01-20 20:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207544, 757611, 15204, '<td valign="top">The bologna (sp?) tongue sticking out makes it :)  I like the grungy background and the muted colors.  7 from me.</td>', 'The bologna (sp?) tongue sticking out makes it :)  I like the grungy background and the muted colors.  7 from me.', '2009-01-20 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207546, 757506, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit from the front and the back.  Her pose/posture and the large amount of foreground that she occupies makes her look a little bigger than I think she is (she''s a very lovely model).  7 from me.</td>', 'Very nicely lit from the front and the back.  Her pose/posture and the large amount of foreground that she occupies makes her look a little bigger than I think she is (she''s a very lovely model).  7 from me.', '2009-01-20 20:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207548, 757203, 15204, '<td valign="top">I love the backlighting.  I don''t like the tilt (although I rarely like tilts).  A reflector or anything up front to bounce some light back onto their faces would have helped the skin tones ont be so flat.  6 from me.</td>', 'I love the backlighting.  I don''t like the tilt (although I rarely like tilts).  A reflector or anything up front to bounce some light back onto their faces would have helped the skin tones ont be so flat.  6 from me.', '2009-01-20 20:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
