(5207590, 757219, 102024, '<td valign="top">Seems just a tad blurry, which is distracting me for some reason.  Otherwise, I like the lighting, but the strong horizontal line doesn''t really do much for this photograph.</td>', 'Seems just a tad blurry, which is distracting me for some reason.  Otherwise, I like the lighting, but the strong horizontal line doesn''t really do much for this photograph.', '2009-01-20 20:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
