(5207597, 756823, 102024, '<td valign="top">Image seems pretty soft.  The colors are a bit all over the place which is distracting, and there aren''t any strong lines to lead your eye through the composition.</td>', 'Image seems pretty soft.  The colors are a bit all over the place which is distracting, and there aren''t any strong lines to lead your eye through the composition.', '2009-01-20 21:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
