(5207610, 757686, 102024, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  My only complaint is that the richness of the blue really overpowers the color depth in the eye (which, I can see, has beautiful colors in it).  But perhaps that''s what you were going for, considering your title?</td>', 'Well composed.  My only complaint is that the richness of the blue really overpowers the color depth in the eye (which, I can see, has beautiful colors in it).  But perhaps that''s what you were going for, considering your title?', '2009-01-20 21:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207612, 755862, 102024, '<td valign="top">Strong tones.  Interesting that you chose to frame the subject within the confines of that stick.  It sort of cuts the subject out of the rest of the image.  Not sure how I feel about that... but it seems to really empty out the space on the other side of the vertical lines and disrupt the flow of the image.</td>', 'Strong tones.  Interesting that you chose to frame the subject within the confines of that stick.  It sort of cuts the subject out of the rest of the image.  Not sure how I feel about that... but it seems to really empty out the space on the other side of the vertical lines and disrupt the flow of the image.', '2009-01-20 21:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207615, 757762, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the simple composition.  Not too sure how the strong light works with the way this was edited.  I think that if it was 100% B&amp;W it may work well, but as it is with the hint of color just sort of takes away from the image, imo.</td>', 'I like the simple composition.  Not too sure how the strong light works with the way this was edited.  I think that if it was 100% B&W it may work well, but as it is with the hint of color just sort of takes away from the image, imo.', '2009-01-20 21:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
