(5210264, 757506, 102024, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... honestly, I don''t get the sense of vanity.  When I think of vanity, I think brighter, more vibrant colors.  Something extravagant and ostentatious... plenty of make-up objects lying around all at the beckoning call of the subject.<br/> <br/>I do like that this is a more intimate, personal picture... I just feel that it sort of detracts from the conveyance of personality, especially "vanity"</td>', 'Hmmm... honestly, I don''t get the sense of vanity.  When I think of vanity, I think brighter, more vibrant colors.  Something extravagant and ostentatious... plenty of make-up objects lying around all at the beckoning call of the subject. I do like that this is a more intimate, personal picture... I just feel that it sort of detracts from the conveyance of personality, especially "vanity"', '2009-01-21 18:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210341, 757440, 44534, '<td valign="top">I really like the smile you captured on his face, great!</td>', 'I really like the smile you captured on his face, great!', '2009-01-21 19:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
