(5217170, 757467, 76335, '<td valign="top">Kids are great for this challenge, because, by their very nature, they don''t (or haven''t yet learned) to hide certain personailty traits. If they''re happy, sad, angry, whatever -- they''re not going to hold back. Excellent capture.</td>', 'Kids are great for this challenge, because, by their very nature, they don''t (or haven''t yet learned) to hide certain personailty traits. If they''re happy, sad, angry, whatever -- they''re not going to hold back. Excellent capture.', '2009-01-24 23:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217173, 756799, 76335, '<td valign="top">I can''t see his face and for that matter can''t conclude anything about his personailty. This is more about vocation.</td>', 'I can''t see his face and for that matter can''t conclude anything about his personailty. This is more about vocation.', '2009-01-24 23:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217222, 756953, 90474, '<td valign="top">The subject really needs to be a part of the shot.</td>', 'The subject really needs to be a part of the shot.', '2009-01-25 00:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217226, 756085, 90474, '<td valign="top">The pupils should be larger, but I know it''s tough to do with a kid.  If you are using flash, try to keep the ambient/modeling lights low for a minute or so before the shot to allow the iris to open.</td>', 'The pupils should be larger, but I know it''s tough to do with a kid.  If you are using flash, try to keep the ambient/modeling lights low for a minute or so before the shot to allow the iris to open.', '2009-01-25 01:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217229, 757605, 90474, '<td valign="top">Not to sure of the composition here.  The right side of the frame is very distracting.</td>', 'Not to sure of the composition here.  The right side of the frame is very distracting.', '2009-01-25 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217230, 757686, 90474, '<td valign="top">The detail in the eye is very good, but the detail in the fabric pulls the eye away from the face.</td>', 'The detail in the eye is very good, but the detail in the fabric pulls the eye away from the face.', '2009-01-25 01:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217249, 757224, 90474, '<td valign="top">I know, we''re not voting on the kid, we''re voting of the photo.  I''m a sucker for blue eyes.</td>', 'I know, we''re not voting on the kid, we''re voting of the photo.  I''m a sucker for blue eyes.', '2009-01-25 01:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217496, 757760, 96924, '<td valign="top">I feel your composition could have been better. You tried to get in too  much detail like the toys on the floor, etc. If you had a close-up of the child on the edge of the rail with more focus on that smile, it would probable have done better. Or if you really wanted the toys, put him on the floor among the toys and take the photo from low down.<br/> <br/>But overall I feel that face should have received much more emphasis.</td>', 'I feel your composition could have been better. You tried to get in too  much detail like the toys on the floor, etc. If you had a close-up of the child on the edge of the rail with more focus on that smile, it would probable have done better. Or if you really wanted the toys, put him on the floor among the toys and take the photo from low down. But overall I feel that face should have received much more emphasis.', '2009-01-25 06:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217500, 757310, 96924, '<td valign="top">First look I wrote this off for the harsh light, high contrast and the dogs eyes. Then I liked it more and more - especially the woman''s expression. I still ended up thinking that the dog''s eyes are distracting and robs it of some of its personality. It draws one''s eyes to it all the time.<br/> <br/>Apart from that - a great story here.</td>', 'First look I wrote this off for the harsh light, high contrast and the dogs eyes. Then I liked it more and more - especially the woman''s expression. I still ended up thinking that the dog''s eyes are distracting and robs it of some of its personality. It draws one''s eyes to it all the time. Apart from that - a great story here.', '2009-01-25 06:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217504, 756823, 96924, '<td valign="top">It is difficult to judge personality from this. Maybe if your shot included his eyes or concentration or stare it would have enhanced the photo.</td>', 'It is difficult to judge personality from this. Maybe if your shot included his eyes or concentration or stare it would have enhanced the photo.', '2009-01-25 06:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217511, 757692, 96924, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo and you captured the moment just right. I do feel however that a darker environment (especially on the back wall) and some light on the face would have focused the photo on that "focus" you are trying to capture here. You composition does not draw the attention to the face automatically.</td>', 'This is a good photo and you captured the moment just right. I do feel however that a darker environment (especially on the back wall) and some light on the face would have focused the photo on that "focus" you are trying to capture here. You composition does not draw the attention to the face automatically.', '2009-01-25 07:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217516, 755553, 96924, '<td valign="top">This is really such a nice photo! This overexposed hat spoils it a bit. As you were allowed advanced editing, you could probably have done something to correct this.</td>', 'This is really such a nice photo! This overexposed hat spoils it a bit. As you were allowed advanced editing, you could probably have done something to correct this.', '2009-01-25 07:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217533, 757612, 47791, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well. <br/>The subject isn''t very appealling but this has nothing to do with the quality of the shot. Good idea going B&amp;W also.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well. The subject isn''t very appealling but this has nothing to do with the quality of the shot. Good idea going B&W also.', '2009-01-25 08:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217600, 757789, 86322, '<td valign="top">Love his expression in this picture, it is one of the few that you can actually see his personality thru the photo. Great job.</td>', 'Love his expression in this picture, it is one of the few that you can actually see his personality thru the photo. Great job.', '2009-01-25 09:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217601, 756913, 86322, '<td valign="top">I like his expression, and it goes well with the picture, a little grainy, but then again it could probably be the look that you were looking for. Great shot.</td>', 'I like his expression, and it goes well with the picture, a little grainy, but then again it could probably be the look that you were looking for. Great shot.', '2009-01-25 09:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217604, 755680, 86322, '<td valign="top">Great picture, his face tells me for real inquisitive.</td>', 'Great picture, his face tells me for real inquisitive.', '2009-01-25 09:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217606, 757090, 86322, '<td valign="top">I like the his expression here but for me it is a little out of focus and the combination with the very sharp eyes looks acward to me.</td>', 'I like the his expression here but for me it is a little out of focus and the combination with the very sharp eyes looks acward to me.', '2009-01-25 09:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217652, 757440, 62187, '<td valign="top">Oh to be a kid again - those were the days - I think I remember? I like the border but it looks strange along the top: 8</td>', 'Oh to be a kid again - those were the days - I think I remember? I like the border but it looks strange along the top: 8', '2009-01-25 09:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217655, 757762, 62187, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems just a tad bright but maybe the girl is too! 8</td>', 'The lighting seems just a tad bright but maybe the girl is too! 8', '2009-01-25 09:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217658, 757465, 62187, '<td valign="top">Something about the focus is strange to me: it seems very crisp in some places and off where it should be sharp. Overall, I like the photo and they do look like they''ve had enough: 8</td>', 'Something about the focus is strange to me: it seems very crisp in some places and off where it should be sharp. Overall, I like the photo and they do look like they''ve had enough: 8', '2009-01-25 10:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217659, 757448, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a pretty good photo for the challenge. To me, a less centered main subject would make a better composition. I''ll score it at 8.</td>', 'I think it''s a pretty good photo for the challenge. To me, a less centered main subject would make a better composition. I''ll score it at 8.', '2009-01-25 10:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217662, 757543, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, your title certainly fits the photo: 8</td>', 'Well, your title certainly fits the photo: 8', '2009-01-25 10:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217665, 757206, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and great contrasting colors: 8</td>', 'Nice focus and great contrasting colors: 8', '2009-01-25 10:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217671, 757569, 62187, '<td valign="top">I was gonna score this at 8. But now I look again, I realize the things I didn''t like actually help the photo. I thought it might look better without the floor. But now I see it gives the photo perspective of the height she is jumping. And, now I realize that she was probably running and jumped that high: not a free standing jump. You have great focus and the lighting is perfect. Bumping to 10</td>', 'I was gonna score this at 8. But now I look again, I realize the things I didn''t like actually help the photo. I thought it might look better without the floor. But now I see it gives the photo perspective of the height she is jumping. And, now I realize that she was probably running and jumped that high: not a free standing jump. You have great focus and the lighting is perfect. Bumping to 10', '2009-01-25 10:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217679, 757621, 62187, '<td valign="top">My first vote was an 8. I''m bumping it to a 10 ''cause I see now it''s just a great photo in a great setting.</td>', 'My first vote was an 8. I''m bumping it to a 10 ''cause I see now it''s just a great photo in a great setting.', '2009-01-25 10:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217680, 757298, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, I think it''s a pretty good photo, especially for this challenge. The lighting seems just a tad bit too bright to me: 8</td>', 'Well, I think it''s a pretty good photo, especially for this challenge. The lighting seems just a tad bit too bright to me: 8', '2009-01-25 10:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217682, 757053, 62187, '<td valign="top">Geez - the photographic quality is perfect and ''Anticipation'' is an awesome feeling. She certainly looks happy and thanks for not making her be naked (Simply because I think nudity should be very limited here at DPC). I''m kicking myself for this: 10</td>', 'Geez - the photographic quality is perfect and ''Anticipation'' is an awesome feeling. She certainly looks happy and thanks for not making her be naked (Simply because I think nudity should be very limited here at DPC). I''m kicking myself for this: 10', '2009-01-25 10:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217685, 757545, 62187, '<td valign="top">I wanted to give this a 10 but to me, even though you''ve done a great job managing it, I think the lighting is still just a tad too bright. As is: 9</td>', 'I wanted to give this a 10 but to me, even though you''ve done a great job managing it, I think the lighting is still just a tad too bright. As is: 9', '2009-01-25 10:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217698, 756876, 57447, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m there...nice capture</td>', 'I feel like I''m there...nice capture', '2009-01-25 10:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217708, 755680, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and lighting: 8</td>', 'Nice crop and lighting: 8', '2009-01-25 10:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217712, 757589, 62187, '<td valign="top">I would have voted this a 10 but it seems a tad too grainy to me. Some of the other entry''s in this challenge have seemed grainy too but the noise worked in them because they were photos of grumpy old men. This little girl, I think, should look smooth. Without knowing the details of the photo, I''m guessing the lighting was low and ISO set too high???? Anyway, I''m still going fairly high with an 8.</td>', 'I would have voted this a 10 but it seems a tad too grainy to me. Some of the other entry''s in this challenge have seemed grainy too but the noise worked in them because they were photos of grumpy old men. This little girl, I think, should look smooth. Without knowing the details of the photo, I''m guessing the lighting was low and ISO set too high???? Anyway, I''m still going fairly high with an 8.', '2009-01-25 10:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217719, 757687, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess I''m going to just have to trust you. The focus is certainly nice: 8</td>', 'Well, I guess I''m going to just have to trust you. The focus is certainly nice: 8', '2009-01-25 10:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
