(5218854, 757304, 100106, '<td valign="top">Love the subject and where he''s looking. Maybe a tad over saturated. Just commenting, not voting.</td>', 'Love the subject and where he''s looking. Maybe a tad over saturated. Just commenting, not voting.', '2009-01-25 22:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
