(5219490, 757300, 47294, '<td valign="top">Hey Melenthia, it''s been quite a while alright and it''s great to hear from you.  There seems to be quite a few new faces on DPC and most the big guns from my days seem to have moved on.  <br/> <br/>Since my break, I''ve entered a few challenges and DPC is as addictive as ever!  Nic (Manic35) and I are about to come across to the ''Darkside'' (ie Canon) anytime soon with the purchase of a 40D, can''t wait!  I see you have been very busy on the site, 266 entries!  Where has the time gone?!  BTW, love your Free-Study entry 2008-04, that''s my kind of photography.</td>', 'Hey Melenthia, it''s been quite a while alright and it''s great to hear from you.  There seems to be quite a few new faces on DPC and most the big guns from my days seem to have moved on.   Since my break, I''ve entered a few challenges and DPC is as addictive as ever!  Nic (Manic35) and I are about to come across to the ''Darkside'' (ie Canon) anytime soon with the purchase of a 40D, can''t wait!  I see you have been very busy on the site, 266 entries!  Where has the time gone?!  BTW, love your Free-Study entry 2008-04, that''s my kind of photography.', '2009-01-26 05:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
