(5219510, 757611, 48389, '<td valign="top">Well, I had this down as being <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=20608" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">MAK</a>!! My apologies for calling you an old g*t! lol</td>', 'Well, I had this down as being  MAK!! My apologies for calling you an old g*t! lol', '2009-01-26 05:50:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219530, 757474, 97893, '<td valign="top">Now I should say, I like this image very much.<br/> <br/>It brings out the mood and personality of a person much more than perhaps any image in this challenge. The post-processing or the IR as you tell, adds to the image in my view. It is soft, yet strong in conveying. I am not sure if I like the title; it sorts of distracts. Perhaps something like ''stillness'' as in stillness of thought, might convey something better or appropriate. (Just my view!_ Tough luck that it didn''t score a lot better. <br/> <br/>A very different portrait and makes me very happy!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Vikram<br/> <br/>p.s. Also goes into my favorites.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-26 06:26:31.</i></td>', 'Now I should say, I like this image very much. It brings out the mood and personality of a person much more than perhaps any image in this challenge. The post-processing or the IR as you tell, adds to the image in my view. It is soft, yet strong in conveying. I am not sure if I like the title; it sorts of distracts. Perhaps something like ''stillness'' as in stillness of thought, might convey something better or appropriate. (Just my view!_ Tough luck that it didn''t score a lot better.  A very different portrait and makes me very happy! Regards,Vikram p.s. Also goes into my favorites.', '2009-01-26 06:22:38.000000', '2009-01-26 06:26:31.000000', 0),
