(5219743, 757495, 52285, '<td valign="top">Finally I gave you 7 (but could have given 8); I think the photo has something, even though it does not entirely fit the challenge title (but I am not one to rate low because it DNMC). I think the minus here is the focus issue (sharper on body than on face), that depends on your intention upon shooting (as you said, she turned unexpectedly). But, I think it is an interesting shoot.</td>', 'Finally I gave you 7 (but could have given 8); I think the photo has something, even though it does not entirely fit the challenge title (but I am not one to rate low because it DNMC). I think the minus here is the focus issue (sharper on body than on face), that depends on your intention upon shooting (as you said, she turned unexpectedly). But, I think it is an interesting shoot.', '2009-01-26 09:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
