(5219890, 757506, 100301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by picturesbykim:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the concept of this photo.  The issue I have is where the light falls.  The vanity is in her face, and her obsession with her looks while applying makeup.  The light falling on her breasts draws the eye away from her eyes.  Has the lighting been different I would have scored higher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>it''s the <i>light</i> that draws the eye there?  If you say so...   But this should have finished much higher.</td>', 'Originally posted by picturesbykim: I like the concept of this photo.  The issue I have is where the light falls.  The vanity is in her face, and her obsession with her looks while applying makeup.  The light falling on her breasts draws the eye away from her eyes.  Has the lighting been different I would have scored higher.   it''s the light that draws the eye there?  If you say so...   But this should have finished much higher.', '2009-01-26 10:17:27.000000', NULL, 0),
