(5220057, 757290, 29011, '<td valign="top">You did a splendid job. I was hoping Dean actually posted a challenge pic for once LOL ;) He has an account here.</td>', 'You did a splendid job. I was hoping Dean actually posted a challenge pic for once LOL ;) He has an account here.', '2009-01-26 11:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220064, 757789, 76335, '<td valign="top">I meant to comment on this. If ever there was a chellenge for kids (without being labeled such), this was it. Whatever they''re feeling, you''re going to get it -- 100%. Anyway, great job -- lots of personality and lots of fun. <br/> <br/>(Someone gave this a one? Really?)</td>', 'I meant to comment on this. If ever there was a chellenge for kids (without being labeled such), this was it. Whatever they''re feeling, you''re going to get it -- 100%. Anyway, great job -- lots of personality and lots of fun.  (Someone gave this a one? Really?)', '2009-01-26 11:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220079, 757821, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Personality? I''m not seeing it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry if that was too blunt. It''s well composed and nicely processed, but in terms of meeting challenge criteria, I guess I had some very different ideas. Here I saw a nicely done maternity portrait, but nothing about her personality. The title didn''t help me get there. Maybe I''m trying too hard. Just my two cents. I do admire your work.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Personality? I''m not seeing it.   Sorry if that was too blunt. It''s well composed and nicely processed, but in terms of meeting challenge criteria, I guess I had some very different ideas. Here I saw a nicely done maternity portrait, but nothing about her personality. The title didn''t help me get there. Maybe I''m trying too hard. Just my two cents. I do admire your work.', '2009-01-26 12:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220087, 757467, 66384, '<td valign="top">Funny and cute! That combination is going to be hard to handle. ;} Congratulations on your top ten star. <br/></td>', 'Funny and cute! That combination is going to be hard to handle. ;} Congratulations on your top ten star. ', '2009-01-26 12:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220102, 757414, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m laughing at your comment. It''s to be expected with hair like that. ;) She''s a beauty.</td>', 'I''m laughing at your comment. It''s to be expected with hair like that. ;) She''s a beauty.', '2009-01-26 12:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220109, 757506, 45524, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jdroullard:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by picturesbykim:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the concept of this photo.  The issue I have is where the light falls.  The vanity is in her face, and her obsession with her looks while applying makeup.  The light falling on her breasts draws the eye away from her eyes.  Has the lighting been different I would have scored higher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>it''s the <i>light</i> that draws the eye there?  If you say so...   But this should have finished much higher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ROFL that is exactly what I was thinking. I know why my eyes were drawn there!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Jdroullard: Originally posted by picturesbykim: I like the concept of this photo.  The issue I have is where the light falls.  The vanity is in her face, and her obsession with her looks while applying makeup.  The light falling on her breasts draws the eye away from her eyes.  Has the lighting been different I would have scored higher.   it''s the light that draws the eye there?  If you say so...   But this should have finished much higher.   ROFL that is exactly what I was thinking. I know why my eyes were drawn there! ', '2009-01-26 12:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220128, 757639, 86447, '<td valign="top">She drumps very well.   Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'She drumps very well.   Congrats on your ribbon!', '2009-01-26 12:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220145, 757080, 98171, '<td valign="top">Love the story. love the photo. Congrats!</td>', 'Love the story. love the photo. Congrats!', '2009-01-26 12:22:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220147, 757821, 33535, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Personality? I''m not seeing it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry if that was too blunt. It''s well composed and nicely processed, but in terms of meeting challenge criteria, I guess I had some very different ideas. Here I saw a nicely done maternity portrait, but nothing about her personality. The title didn''t help me get there. Maybe I''m trying too hard. Just my two cents. I do admire your work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for clarifying! <br/> <br/>As i stated in my details, i didn''t feel too comfy entering this shot either. Not because it contains nudity, but because i felt i could (and should) have gotten a better and more natural looking shot for this challenge. However i personally think it does fit the theme. Pregnancy is such a special and character building time, not to mention becoming a mom and being responsible for your child, especially in a very young age (she''s my age and it''s her second child btw) so i felt that this very simple yet honest photograph showed some of the flavor of that special and "moving" time. Plus her unborn child will be grown into his or her (they don''t know yet) very own personality quite soon i''m sure so it was actually up to your interpretation and imagination to "see" the personality in this shot...;)</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Originally posted by bvy: Personality? I''m not seeing it.   Sorry if that was too blunt. It''s well composed and nicely processed, but in terms of meeting challenge criteria, I guess I had some very different ideas. Here I saw a nicely done maternity portrait, but nothing about her personality. The title didn''t help me get there. Maybe I''m trying too hard. Just my two cents. I do admire your work.   Thanks for clarifying!  As i stated in my details, i didn''t feel too comfy entering this shot either. Not because it contains nudity, but because i felt i could (and should) have gotten a better and more natural looking shot for this challenge. However i personally think it does fit the theme. Pregnancy is such a special and character building time, not to mention becoming a mom and being responsible for your child, especially in a very young age (she''s my age and it''s her second child btw) so i felt that this very simple yet honest photograph showed some of the flavor of that special and "moving" time. Plus her unborn child will be grown into his or her (they don''t know yet) very own personality quite soon i''m sure so it was actually up to your interpretation and imagination to "see" the personality in this shot...;)', '2009-01-26 12:23:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220152, 757605, 98171, '<td valign="top">I''m shocked to see this so far into the pages. This deserved much more. Lovely image.</td>', 'I''m shocked to see this so far into the pages. This deserved much more. Lovely image.', '2009-01-26 12:24:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5220153, 757760, 66494, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. It took me back some 25 years when our youngest used to get out of the crib so fast that he could beat us out of the room. He went from perfect baby to toddler terror!  Love the name his brother gave him, sometimes they fit just too too well.</td>', 'Love this shot. It took me back some 25 years when our youngest used to get out of the crib so fast that he could beat us out of the room. He went from perfect baby to toddler terror!  Love the name his brother gave him, sometimes they fit just too too well.', '2009-01-26 12:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
