(5220171, 757465, 80096, '<td valign="top">Well done, Jamie! My only criticism would be his face appears a tad on the soft side. I think the PP for that might have been adjusted so it looks a little more natural. Neat Image tends to over-soften skin tones and I''ve had difficulties with this myself so I tend to avoid portraitures.   <br/> <br/>Otherwise, it''s a real gem, the expression is priceless, the pose and crop perfect. I also like the B/W tone for this. Excellent choice! I think you''re definitely on the right path. Keep up the good work!! ;-)</td>', 'Well done, Jamie! My only criticism would be his face appears a tad on the soft side. I think the PP for that might have been adjusted so it looks a little more natural. Neat Image tends to over-soften skin tones and I''ve had difficulties with this myself so I tend to avoid portraitures.    Otherwise, it''s a real gem, the expression is priceless, the pose and crop perfect. I also like the B/W tone for this. Excellent choice! I think you''re definitely on the right path. Keep up the good work!! ;-)', '2009-01-26 12:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
