(5221305, 757551, 39427, '<td valign="top">Its a real cute shot and the technicals are very nice but I''m afraid we''ve all just sorta seen this shot done before, and in general i don''t think the DPC crowd likes portraits of what looks to be the photographer''s children or their pets, unless they are exceptionally creative.  The faces might be a tad over exposed but there really is nothing to complain about this shot, but also not much for sustained interest.</td>', 'Its a real cute shot and the technicals are very nice but I''m afraid we''ve all just sorta seen this shot done before, and in general i don''t think the DPC crowd likes portraits of what looks to be the photographer''s children or their pets, unless they are exceptionally creative.  The faces might be a tad over exposed but there really is nothing to complain about this shot, but also not much for sustained interest.', '2009-01-26 23:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
