(5221916, 757551, 42495, '<td valign="top">For me the biggest thing that kept the score low was the exposure on the faces, they just seems a tad harsh to look at it.  Also, they seem a bit posed and not natural.  Posing subjects isn''t bad, but if they are just "Monkey''ing Around" they probably wouldn''t be in this position.<br/> <br/>Take a look at these and compare side by side to see how the lighting affect the faces.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=601377" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/751/120/601377.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/751/120/601377.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/751/120/601377.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=618547" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/769/120/618547.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/769/120/618547.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/769/120/618547.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Edit: I didn''t vote but would have given it a 6.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-27 12:10:13.</i></td>', 'For me the biggest thing that kept the score low was the exposure on the faces, they just seems a tad harsh to look at it.  Also, they seem a bit posed and not natural.  Posing subjects isn''t bad, but if they are just "Monkey''ing Around" they probably wouldn''t be in this position. Take a look at these and compare side by side to see how the lighting affect the faces.     Edit: I didn''t vote but would have given it a 6.', '2009-01-27 12:09:45.000000', '2009-01-27 12:10:13.000000', 0),
