(5237234, 757094, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you did this, but this is darn near 3D.  I feel as though I am in the same room, right across from her, and I can reach out and feel that yarn.  I wonder if people found this disconcerting without realizing it?  I think it''s quite amazing.  Oh, and I love the clash of plaids.  :-)</td>', 'I''m not sure how you did this, but this is darn near 3D.  I feel as though I am in the same room, right across from her, and I can reach out and feel that yarn.  I wonder if people found this disconcerting without realizing it?  I think it''s quite amazing.  Oh, and I love the clash of plaids.  :-)', '2009-02-03 15:27:18.000000', NULL, 0),
